;; narcis carve exceptions — vars kept despite no static caller in
;; src+test, in two groups, each with its reason:
;;
;; 1. narcis.store-eve's public fns are the store seam's API,
;;    reached from narcis.store's facade by
;;    (resolve 'narcis.store-eve/...) — carve's static analysis
;;    cannot see resolve-by-symbol uses.
narcis.store-eve/open
narcis.store-eve/put!
narcis.store-eve/current
narcis.store-eve/version
narcis.store-eve/version-count
narcis.store-eve/close!
;; 2. eve.text is Eve's vendored text engine (src/eve/text.cljc +
;;    src/eve/text/store.cljc): its public API is kept whole so
;;    the vendored copy tracks upstream Eve; narcis consumes the
;;    subset it needs today.
eve.text/text?
eve.text/leaf?
eve.text/text-of
eve.text/text-append
eve.text/text-builder-cr?
eve.text/text-depth
eve.text/text-children
eve.text/text-same-node?
eve.text/text-shares-child?
